# Production Environment Configuration

This file outlines the required environment variables for running the application in a production environment. 

**WARNING: NEVER PUT REAL CREDENTIALS IN THIS FILE. THIS IS DOCUMENTATION ONLY.**

```env
# Deployment mode
ENVIRONMENT=production

# Database (MySQL must not be exposed publicly)
DATABASE_URL=mysql+aiomysql://YOUR_DB_USER:YOUR_DB_PASSWORD@127.0.0.1:3306/YOUR_DB_NAME

# Secrets (Must be long, cryptographically secure random strings)
JWT_SECRET_KEY=YOUR_SECURE_JWT_SECRET
SUBMISSION_SECRET_KEY=YOUR_SECURE_SUBMISSION_SECRET

# AI Config (Never commit this!)
GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY

# Qdrant Vector Database
QDRANT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:6333
QDRANT_API_KEY=YOUR_QDRANT_API_KEY_IF_ANY
QDRANT_COLLECTION=catalog_products
QDRANT_TIMEOUT=30

# Network & Security
# Explicit origin required in production. No wildcards (*)
CORS_ORIGINS=https://your-frontend-domain.com

# Database Connection Pool Settings
DB_POOL_SIZE=20
DB_MAX_OVERFLOW=10
DB_POOL_TIMEOUT=30
DB_POOL_RECYCLE=1800
```
